  "implemented_acceptance": [
    "Native AgentNode visits use real structured routing or invocation-local handoff_to_agent; no persistent registry mutation or inherited closure.",
    "Typed media/JSON input and rich final citation/media output preserve ordering and detached JSON lifetimes.",
    "Reset baselines, borrowed restoration, caller InvocationState identity, sequential admission and independent budgets are explicit.",
    "Opaque node and agent interruption scopes resume through native snapshots, selected storage and nested Graph->Swarm.",
    "Completed bodies persist before handoff callbacks; accepted answers persist before invocation callbacks; cancelled current visits retry without keeping a cancelled aggregate row.",
    "Opaque per-batch tool receipts preserve normalized result authority through duplicate message/call identifiers and context reduction.",
    "Early disposal and cancellation drain admitted iterators; first failures retain identity and later cleanup errors attach under Strands.CleanupErrors."
  ],
  "honest_tdd_process": "Behavioral RED->GREEN increments were run for missing routing, budgets, deadlines, reset baselines, node approval, snapshots, session frontier, authority/cleanup defects, repetition/timeout resume modes and citation projection. Additional passing lifetime, media, save-policy and nesting cases are regression evidence, not claimed as individually RED first.",
